# PRIVATE (미방송분). 1998 night by the reservoir: shore, reeds, water, stone walls, concrete, lantern posts
# (unlit/lit), ladder, generator, utility pole with loudspeakers, sluice building, landing stage,
# old-village roof, reservoir mud, the dog over the wall. Swap with linear.pal / hifi.pal.
@palette ../../../art/palette/night-school.pal
@size 16 16
@output ../tiles/mbs_tiles_shore.png
@preview ../previews/mbs_tiles_shore_x4.png 4
@columns 8

